  "paragraphs": [
    "A 3D transition that divides layers into diamond-shaped segments that rotate vertically or horizontally in an offset fashion to reveal a second layer.",
    "Four Diamond Wave presets mean waving goodbye to long effect setup times. Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste! Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Diamond Wave look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
  ],
